"],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A holder of members.manage chose Create token from a member's row menu (or the \"MCP clients without a token\" notice) on the Members page.","The base state is the form for the Agent claude: an empty label and the default expiry of 90 days.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the dialog is centered over a dimmed ground."],"intent":"Show the Create token dialog of the Members page as built from Adapter Widgets only: a label and an expiry for a member's Token, then the secret shown once with a copy action.","interactionRules":["The form takes an optional label (such as laptop or CI) and an expiry of 90 days, 30 days or never; Create token makes the Token.","Creating shows the Token once, in a read-only field with Copy and the hint for sending it as a bearer header; Close ends the dialog and the secret is never shown again.","A Token acts with its member's current permission keys, so it carries no scope of its own."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"c7d3b101-5a1e-4b6c-8f2d-3e9a0b7c4d01"}],"requirements":["01a11485-eb86-7a69-bf1b-70d492ee3be4","01a11485-ec7b-725c-bcc9-e7c6c7cefc11","01a11485-ebdd-70fc-b853-0621caf056b8"]},"variants":{"expires-never":{"requirements":["01a11485-ec7b-725c-bcc9-e7c6c7cefc11"],"state":{"create-expires":{"valueKey":"access.tokens.expiresNever"},"expires-90":{"selected":false},"expires-never":{"selected":true}}},"expires-open":{"requirements":["01a11485-ec7b-725c-bcc9-e7c6c7cefc11"],"state":{"create-expires":{"open":true}}},"token-revealed":{"requirements":["01a11485-ec61-7124-bb2b-8f0f5ebae011","01a11485-ec2a-7f06-aa9d-895690f2ca5a"],"state":{"create-wrap":{"visible":false},"reveal-wrap":{"visible":true}}}}}
